get.summary:
The provider's redirect (register `<public URL>/api/v1/auth/oidc/callback` there). Always answers `303`
to the node's own web client, `<web>/sso/callback?code=…&state=<client_state>` or `?error=<code>&state=…`;
tokens never appear in URLs.

Download a file (`view_channel`): always `Content-Disposition: attachment`, `nosniff` and a sandboxing CSP;
only raster images, audio, video, PDF and plain text keep their type. Single byte ranges (`Range`) are
answered with 206.
